{"id":"ec2bd1910f273ef9","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-kt-effective-list.md","title":"K平凡序列可连同常数有效列举","display":"thm-kt-effective-list — K平凡序列可连同常数有效列举","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-kt-effective-list","aliases":["43-thm-kt-effective-list"],"display":"thm-kt-effective-list — K平凡序列可连同常数有效列举","depends_on":["[[43-df-ktrivial]]","[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","[[43-df-computable]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"Theorem 15.2.1; printed pp.432–434 / PDF pp.452–454","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision_round":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-kt-effective-list"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-kt-effective-list</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kt-effective-list — K平凡序列可连同常数有效列举"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ccd45302acc926e6\" href=\"?note=ccd45302acc926e6\" title=\"43-df-ktrivial\">43-df-ktrivial</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 15.2.1; printed pp.432–434 / PDF pp.452–454"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KTrivial}\">\\(\\mathrm{KTrivial}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TotalComputable}\">\\(\\operatorname{TotalComputable}\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ccd45302acc926e6\" href=\"?note=ccd45302acc926e6\" title=\"43-df-ktrivial\">43-df-ktrivial</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6cd902d852c2c848\" href=\"?note=6cd902d852c2c848\" title=\"43-df-prefixkolm\">43-df-prefixkolm</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,s,x,n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e,s,x,n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。以下存在量化的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B:\\mathbb N^3\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(B:\\mathbb N^3\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d,c:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(d,c:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为全函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X:\\mathbb N\\to2^\\omega\">\\(X:\\mathbb N\\to2^\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\exists B,d,c,X\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(B)\\land\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(d)\\land\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(c)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall e,s,x\\;(x\\ge s\\Rightarrow B(e,s,x)=0)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall e,x\\;\\exists s_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s\\ge s_0\\;B(e,s,x)=X(e)(x)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall e,n\\;K(X(e)\\upharpoonright n)\\le K(n)+d(e)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall Y\\in2^\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{KTrivial}(Y)\\Rightarrow\\exists e\\;X(e)=Y\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall e,x\\;\\left|\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:B(e,s+1,x)\\ne B(e,s,x)\\}\\right|\\le c(e)(x+1)^2\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\exists B,d,c,X\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(B)\\land\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(d)\\land\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(c)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall e,s,x\\;(x\\ge s\\Rightarrow B(e,s,x)=0)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall e,x\\;\\exists s_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s\\ge s_0\\;B(e,s,x)=X(e)(x)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall e,n\\;K(X(e)\\upharpoonright n)\\le K(n)+d(e)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall Y\\in2^\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{KTrivial}(Y)\\Rightarrow\\exists e\\;X(e)=Y\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall e,x\\;\\left|\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:B(e,s+1,x)\\ne B(e,s,x)\\}\\right|\\le c(e)(x+1)^2\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有效的是二维近似表与随编号给出的常数，不是极限序列本身为统一可计算。用(x+1)²吸收x=0与有限初段的O(x²)边界。原稿Lemma 15.2.2证明含“DENIS NEED TO FIX”并转引未在本轮核验的论文，本条保留来源陈述而禁止作为已核验证明依据。</p>\n<p>来源：用户提供的2007-07-28草稿，Theorem 15.2.1; printed pp.432–434 / PDF pp.452–454。本轮逐项比对来源陈述并人工核对类型、参数和去Remark条件；未声称机器形式验证或来源完整证明核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-ktrivial","status":"resolved","id":"ccd45302acc926e6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ktrivial]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-prefixkolm]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ktrivial","status":"resolved","id":"ccd45302acc926e6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{KTrivial}$、$K$、$\\operatorname{TotalComputable}$ 分别见 [[43-df-ktrivial]]、[[43-df-prefixkolm]]、[[43-df-computable]]；$e,s,x,n\\in\\mathbb N$。以下存在量化的 $B:\\mathbb N^3\\to\\{0,1\\}$、$d,c:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 为全函数，$X:\\mathbb N\\to2^\\omega$。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-prefixkolm","status":"resolved","id":"6cd902d852c2c848","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{KTrivial}$、$K$、$\\operatorname{TotalComputable}$ 分别见 [[43-df-ktrivial]]、[[43-df-prefixkolm]]、[[43-df-computable]]；$e,s,x,n\\in\\mathbb N$。以下存在量化的 $B:\\mathbb N^3\\to\\{0,1\\}$、$d,c:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 为全函数，$X:\\mathbb N\\to2^\\omega$。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{KTrivial}$、$K$、$\\operatorname{TotalComputable}$ 分别见 [[43-df-ktrivial]]、[[43-df-prefixkolm]]、[[43-df-computable]]；$e,s,x,n\\in\\mathbb N$。以下存在量化的 $B:\\mathbb N^3\\to\\{0,1\\}$、$d,c:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 为全函数，$X:\\mathbb N\\to2^\\omega$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{KTrivial}","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TotalComputable}","display":false},{"tex":"e,s,x,n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"B:\\mathbb N^3\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"d,c:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"X:\\mathbb N\\to2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\exists B,d,c,X\\;\\Bigl(&\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(B)\\land\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(d)\\land\\operatorname{TotalComputable}(c)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall e,s,x\\;(x\\ge s\\Rightarrow B(e,s,x)=0)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall e,x\\;\\exists s_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s\\ge s_0\\;B(e,s,x)=X(e)(x)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall e,n\\;K(X(e)\\upharpoonright n)\\le K(n)+d(e)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall Y\\in2^\\omega\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{KTrivial}(Y)\\Rightarrow\\exists e\\;X(e)=Y\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall e,x\\;\\left|\\{s\\in\\mathbb N:B(e,s+1,x)\\ne B(e,s,x)\\}\\right|\\le c(e)(x+1)^2\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2171,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-409","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-kt-effective-list]] — K平凡序列可连同常数有效列举"}],"outgoing":["ccd45302acc926e6","6cd902d852c2c848","f357216a7edb035a"]}